### Review Service API tests (IntelliJ HTTP Client)
### Base URL and tokens — replace JWT values after logging in via user-service
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8089
@courseId = 101
@reviewId = 1
@studentToken = REPLACE_WITH_STUDENT_JWT
@adminToken = REPLACE_WITH_ADMIN_JWT

### ─── Public APIs (no auth) ───────────────────────────────────────────────

### Get course reviews (paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reviews/course/{{courseId}}?page=0&size=10&sort=createdAt,desc
Accept: application/json

###

### Get course rating summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reviews/course/{{courseId}}/summary
Accept: application/json

###

### ─── Student APIs (JWT required) ───────────────────────────────────────────

### Create review (requires enrollment in course)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "courseId": {{courseId}},
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": "Excellent course with practical examples."
}

###

### Get my review for a course
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reviews/my/course/{{courseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Update own review
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/reviews/{{reviewId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rating": 4,
  "comment": "Updated review after completing the course."
}

###

### Delete own review
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/reviews/{{reviewId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

###

### ─── Admin APIs (ADMIN role JWT) ───────────────────────────────────────────

### List all reviews
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/reviews?page=0&size=20&sort=createdAt,desc
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Get review details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/reviews/{{reviewId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Hide review
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/reviews/{{reviewId}}/hide
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### Unhide review
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/reviews/{{reviewId}}/unhide
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### Admin delete review
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/reviews/{{reviewId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### Swagger UI
GET {{baseUrl}}/swagger-ui.html

###
